<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71807" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνάν</span></b> ; 
			Ion.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνέων</span></b>  ; 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνών</span></b> :— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>joint-owner, partner,</i> c.
			gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					595
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργων ἀργαλέων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				601
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκέων ξυνάονες,</span> i.e.
				<i>afflicted by</i> sores, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.48
			</span></i> : abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνάν</span>”
				<i>friend,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>N.</u>
					5.27
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					1074
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένου σέβας ἤμειψα, παίδων δ᾽
				ἐζύγην ξυνάονι</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				99.6
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσὶν ζευχθεῖσα φίλοις ξυνάοσι
				τέκνων,</span> i.e. having married two husbands, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				241a3
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλα ξυνέωνα</span> the salt <i>on the common table,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aet.
				3.15
			</span></i>.</div>
